## EVENT SYSTEM

**Two parallel buses exist** (known architectural debt, merging planned):

| Bus | Location | Style | Used by |
|-----|----------|-------|---------|
| `IEventBus`/`SimpleEventBus` | `Assets/Ashfall.Core/Events/` | String-based, constructor-injected | Defined but **underused** by core systems |
| `EventBus` static class | `Assets/_Game/Core/EventBus.cs` | Type-safe generics, allocation-free, editor profiling | The real decoupler on Unity side |

**Godot** has no event bus integration — uses direct method calls on host sessions.

**Rule:** Every public system raises C# events on state change (for UI + save). Use whichever bus is wired in the host. Unity's `EventBus.IsSuppressed` flag is used during save/load restore.

